<title>USA: Magellan Baca Valley well being tested.</title>
<headline>Magellan Baca Valley well being tested.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, Conn. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Magellan Petroleum Corp said on Wednesday that its Dogwood wildcat well in Colorado's Baca Valley has reached its total depth and is now being tested.</p>
<p>If the tests are unfavorable, the company said it will write off all remaining costs from the venture and take an after-tax charge of $1.1 million in the fourth quarter.</p>
</text>
